{"id":11192,"artist":"Buffalo Springfield","title":"For What It's Worth","lyrics_plain":"There's something happening here.\nWhat it is ain't exactly clear.\nThere's a man with a gun over there,\nTellin' me I got to beware.\nI think it's time we stop, children,\nwhat's that sound?\nEv'rybody look what's goin' down.\nThere's battle lines bein' drawn.\nNobody's right if ev'rybody's wrong.\nYoung people speakin' their minds,\nGettin' so much resistance from behind.\nI think it's time we stop, hey,\nWhat's that sound?\nEv'rybody look what's goin' down.\nWhat a field day for the heat.\nA thousand people in the street.\nSingin' songs and carrying signs,\nMostly saying, \"Hooray for our side.\"\nI think it's time we stop, hey,\nWhat's that sound?\nEv'rybody look what's goin' down.\nParanoia strikes deep,\nInto your life it will creep.\nIt starts when you're always afraid.\nStep out of line, the man come and take you away.\nYou better stop, hey, what's that sound?\nEv'rybody look what's goin' down.\nStop, now, what's that sound?\nEv'rybody look what's goin' down.","lyrics_synced":"[00:10.31] There's something happening here.\n[00:14.38] What it is ain't exactly clear.\n[00:19.38] There's a man with a gun over there,\n[00:24.38] Tellin' me I got to beware.\n[00:28.91] I think it's time we stop, children,\n[00:31.56] what's that sound?\n[00:32.50] Ev'rybody look what's goin' down.\n[00:45.31] There's battle lines bein' drawn.\n[00:49.38] Nobody's right if ev'rybody's wrong.\n[00:55.31] Young people speakin' their minds,\n[00:59.38] Gettin' so much resistance from behind.\n[01:03.91] I think it's time we stop, hey,\n[01:06.25] What's that sound?\n[01:07.19] Ev'rybody look what's goin' down.\n[01:20.63] What a field day for the heat.\n[01:24.38] A thousand people in the street.\n[01:29.38] Singin' songs and carrying signs,\n[01:34.38] Mostly saying, \"Hooray for our side.\"\n[01:38.91] I think it's time we stop, hey,\n[01:41.25] What's that sound?\n[01:42.19] Ev'rybody look what